id: class-avatar
name: Class Avatar
type: awakening
subtype: greater
origin: mind
racial: Any
prerequisites: N/A
tier: 1+
maxStacks: 1
aspects: 
bonuses: AG +1, FO +1, TE +1, MA +1
description: >
  The road to your destiny stands before you, leading into an unknown future. What is known for sure, however, is that wherever you end up, you'll be right where you need to be. In order to reach that destiny, however, you'll have to specialize your combat style. Regardless, you are one of the chosen few, a true paragon of destiny: a Class Avatar.
text: >
  The road to your destiny stands before you, leading into an unknown future. What is known for sure, however, is that wherever you end up, you'll be right where you need to be. In order to reach that destiny, however, you'll have to specialize your combat style. Regardless, you are one of the chosen few, a true paragon of destiny: a Class Avatar.

  Racial Requirement: Any / Transformation Type: Awakening / Awakening Type: Greater / Awakening Origin: Mind / Prerequisite(s): N/A / Maximum No of Stacks: 1 / Tier of Power Requirement. 1+
  AG +1 · FO +1 · TE +1 · SC – · IN – · MA +1 · PE –

  Path of the Avatar: Your destiny is decided; the path you walk will follow one of the chosen roads, leading you to specialize in your destined combat role.
  (1)-[Ruling]: Upon gaining access to this Awakening, select your 'Destined Class': Hero, Elite, or Berserker. If you have access to the Class Up Awakening, you must select the Destined Class that matches the Class you selected for the Option effect of Class Up, or vice-versa if you gain access to Class Up while possessing this Awakening.
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain one of the following effects depending on which effect matches the name of your Destined Class:
  Hero [Passive]: Increase your Dodge Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  Elite [Passive]: Increase your Strike Rolls and Surgency by 1(T).
  Berserker [Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: The Class Up Awakening does not count towards your Awakening Limit.
  (4)-[Adventuring]: You may spend an hour outside of a Combat Encounter to apply the 'Class Mark' Apparel Quality to any of your pieces of Apparel if they have a Quality Slot free.

  Class Mark Apparel Quality — Class Mark: This piece of Apparel has the mark of your destiny emblazoned on it.
  –Apparel Category: All –Prerequisites: The wearer possesses the Class Avatar Awakening –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Depending on your Destined Class, apply the following effects:
  Hero [Passive]: While you have 2+ stacks of Power, increase this piece of Apparel's Apparel Bonus by 1(bT).
  Elite [Passive]: Increase your Surgency by 1/2 (rounded up) of the Apparel Bonus.
  Berserker [Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Signature Techniques by the Apparel Bonus.

---

